#39;s latest play - The Boston Bombings. Please have a look and see what you think.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Best Regards</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/4506247898646610684'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/4506247898646610684'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html?showComment=1367801077048#c4506247898646610684' title=''/><author><name>WashingtonDeathCult</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1981157627527927253' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1981157627527927253' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-639668463"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 5, 2013 at 6:44 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7238399575149180195</id><published>2013-05-01T00:42:20.296-06:00</published><updated>2013-05-01T00:42:20.296-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Whoops. Sorry Will, my comment was about another a...</title><content type='html'>Whoops. Sorry Will, my comment was about another article, &amp;quot;Presumed Guilty in Florida,&amp;quot; the Florida v. Adkins case. It was the first thing I read on Google+ and this was the continuation of my first comment (Yossarian). &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;That&amp;#39;s why it&amp;#39;s off-topic. In my defense, &amp;quot;I forgot&amp;quot; to make sure I was replying to the same article.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/7238399575149180195'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/7238399575149180195'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html?showComment=1367390540296#c7238399575149180195' title=''/><author><name>Kitty Carr</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03276241501396117972</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh6.googleusercontent.com/-KAYxWfKbvLw/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAXs/8OzsHtKNsCY/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1981157627527927253' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1981157627527927253' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1307421364"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 1, 2013 at 12:42 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4844824603780173753</id><published>2013-05-01T00:36:39.477-06:00</published><updated>2013-05-01T00:36:39.477-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Dear Will,&#xa;&#xa;My mother and I just donated to keep y...</title><content type='html'>Dear Will,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;My mother and I just donated to keep you guys going.  Your blog is one of the very few websites I seriously visit and I appreciate what you&amp;#39;ve done and what you and your family have had to go through to be able to express your views publicly.  Thank you.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;G-d bless you and your family. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Sincerely,&lt;br /&gt;Julie</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/4844824603780173753'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/4844824603780173753'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html?showComment=1367390199477#c4844824603780173753' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1981157627527927253' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1981157627527927253' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-777914246"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="May 1, 2013 at 12:36 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8215335958190803780</id><published>2013-04-30T20:54:46.478-06:00</published><updated>2013-04-30T20:54:46.478-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, I forgot to mention one of the funniest thin...</title><content type='html'>Will, I forgot to mention one of the funniest things I’ve heard about the lengths the SP will go to excuse the police, if the “good faith” exclusion doesn’t work. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In the case of Hudson v. Michigan, a drug case, Kennedy wrote an opinion concurring in part and dissenting in part. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;During the &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.oyez.org/cases/2000-2009/2005/2005_04_1360#reargument/&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;first oral argument&lt;/a&gt;, Kennedy asked: &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;“Well, when there’s probable cause to enter, there’s no presumption of innocence, is there, or am I wrong?”&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;During the &lt;a href=&quot;javascript:void(0);&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;reargument&lt;/a&gt;, Kennedy said:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt;“Suppose the – suppose the officer – excuse me, WE FORGOT TO KNOCK, BUT WE ARE POLICE OFFICERS. We do have a warrant. We’re going to proceed with a search. PLEASE DON’T BE ALARMED. We’re going to – does that do it?”&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;A little later, Kennedy is on the same subject. He asks:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;b&gt; “Suppose the – suppose the officer – excuse me, WE FORGOT TO KNOCK, BUT WE ARE POLICE OFFICERS. We do have a warrant. We’re going to proceed with a search. PLEASE DON’T BE ALARMED. We’re going to – does that do it?”&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Can an “I forgot” exception to the Exclusionary Rule be far behind? And has Kennedy ever met a cop?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Oral arguments can be found on Oyez.com, and can be downloaded to MP3 or printed.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/8215335958190803780'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/8215335958190803780'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html?showComment=1367376886478#c8215335958190803780' title=''/><author><name>Kitty Carr</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03276241501396117972</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh6.googleusercontent.com/-KAYxWfKbvLw/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAXs/8OzsHtKNsCY/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1981157627527927253' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1981157627527927253' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1307421364"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 30, 2013 at 8:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2315755654286253534</id><published>2013-04-29T12:09:49.334-06:00</published><updated>2013-04-29T12:09:49.334-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Sir William you are an inspiration, I hope you get...</title><content type='html'>Sir William you are an inspiration, I hope you get your health back as soon as possible. I just donated again. You should consider downloading the bitcoin client and placing your public wallet address on the blog as another means of donation.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/2315755654286253534'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/2315755654286253534'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html?showComment=1367258989334#c2315755654286253534' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1981157627527927253' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1981157627527927253' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-612455338"/><gd:extende