.post-8538510090379154124</id><published>2013-04-25T11:32:22.013-06:00</published><updated>2013-04-25T11:32:22.013-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,&#xa;&#xa;Thanks for your work.  I again implore you ...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Thanks for your work.  I again implore you to make a button for recurring monthly payments so that people can give without so much activity.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Speedy recovery to you.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Brad</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/8538510090379154124'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/8538510090379154124'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html?showComment=1366911142013#c8538510090379154124' title=''/><author><name>Bradley H Werrell</name><uri>http://redrockhealthcare.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1981157627527927253' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1981157627527927253' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-231955521"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 25, 2013 at 11:32 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6840397503346511000</id><published>2013-04-24T22:47:02.835-06:00</published><updated>2013-04-24T22:47:02.835-06:00</updated><title type='text'>thanks for your work on this...foul stench of Stat...</title><content type='html'>thanks for your work on this...foul stench of State subversion is reeking from this......    please keep up your great journalism....and thoughts and prayers for your health and family my friend!!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/6840397503346511000'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1981157627527927253/comments/default/6840397503346511000'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html?showComment=1366865222835#c6840397503346511000' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2013/04/when-homeland-security-theater-goes-off.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1981157627527927253' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1981157627527927253' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-362758858"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 24, 2013 at 10:47 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8921055940582279951</id><published>2013-04-24T18:13:13.631-06:00</published><updated>2013-04-24T18:13:13.631-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Hello William,&#xa;&#xa;Just now donated. Hope and pray yo...</title><content type='html'>Hello William,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Just now donated. Hope and pray you and yours find good health in the future.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;We need your voice in the mix.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;God Bless,&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;KPatrickRyan</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/328